1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:09,800
Please heaven and earth,

25
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,600
make it so he doesn't see us.

26
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:27,600
Another chain of restrictions...

27
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,600
Damn Six Desires brat,

28
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:31,840
I almost fell for it.

29
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:41,400
As expected, it's a trap.

30
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:42,840
Remnant Rainbow Jade Sword,

31
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:43,320
go !

32
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:45,920
Master,

33
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:46,960
what are you doing ?

34
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,600
Just let him pass.

35
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:50,400
If he finds us, we’re dead !

36
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,760
Wait till I catch you,

37
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,120
I’ll refine you to death !

38
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:05,640
These old Devil Lords are extremely cunning.

39
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:08,040
If he isn't the one to break the restriction,

40
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:10,000
he'll know something's wrong.

41
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:11,760
So that’s why...

42
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:13,240
Master, you’re brilliant !

43
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:18,080
A single strike of that sword broke our restrictions.

44
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,160
Master,

45
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:21,520
if only you had such a trump card too,

46
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:24,040
we wouldn’t have to suffer through each trial like this.

47
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:28,760
Although we’ve temporarily escaped the worst,

48
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:31,960
these two remain a grave threat.

49
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:34,760
On this restriction mountain,

50
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:38,200
eliminating them isn’t impossible.

51
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:47,320
If I didn't have to rescue you from that restriction,

52
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:51,120
I would've reached the summit 3 months ago.

53
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:54,480
But you are the legacy Master left me,

54
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:57,320
how could I bear to abandon you ?

55
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:02,480
Someone's been breaking all the restrictions I placed behind us,

56
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:06,440
it must be that old ghost Duanmu Ji.

57
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:08,680
Alright,

58
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:12,000
once I have solved this final restriction,

59
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:13,800
we'll leave.

60
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:18,880
Such power !

61
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:21,760
It's indeed worthy of being the last step of Restriction Mountain.

62
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:25,320
But as long as I find this restriction's core,

63
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:26,800
I will...

64
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:28,040
Six Desires brat !

65
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,120
I need to thank you

66
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:32,640
for how you prepared the path for me !

67
00:04:37,400 --> 00:04:39,280
Old man, are you mad ?

68
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:40,880
If you trigger this final restriction,

69
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:43,160
we’ll both be annihilated.

70
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,600
I'll slay you down first !

71
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:50,440
This is something I found in a rank 5 country,

72
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:52,080
it's my most precious artifact.

73
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:53,800
You should be honored

74
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:55,240
to be killed by it !

75
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,920
You old freak...

76
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,320
Greed !

77
00:05:12,840 --> 00:05:13,400
This is bad !

78
00:05:26,440 --> 00:05:27,520
Old ghost Duanmu,

79
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:28,720
are you insane ?

80
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:31,160
If I don’t refine you today,

81
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,720
I swear I’m not human !

82
00:05:41,520 --> 00:05:42,520
Six Desires brat,

83
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:46,600
I've watched you slaughter sects specialized in formations for 1000 years.

84
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:49,040
You plunged the Sea of Devils in chaos

85
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:52,200
just to learn how to make these worthless restrictions.

86
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:54,000
I'll show you today

87
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:56,400
how futile formations

88
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:58,240
and restrictions really are !

89
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,560
Ridiculous !

90
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:03,240
You used that Core Formation brat as a decoy,

91
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:06,400
did you ever plan to let him survive past the third trial ?

92
00:06:07,440 --> 00:06:09,440
I immersed myself in the Dao of restrictions

93
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,800
but you, an unscrupulous old lunatic,

94
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:14,000
dares to lecture me !?

95
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,120
You talk too much !

96
00:06:22,440 --> 00:06:24,920
When you set those vicious chain restrictions,

97
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:27,320
you never thought this day would come, did you ?

98
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,160
Now die !

99
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:36,160
What are you talking about ?

100
00:06:36,280 --> 00:06:37,880
Chain restrictions ?

101
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,160
What ?

102
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:41,040
Do you think you can fool me ?

103
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:43,000
Besides you,

104
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:45,280
who could have done it ?

105
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:49,520
Brother Duanmu,

106
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:51,560
I believe this is a misunderstanding.

107
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:53,040
I never set chain restrictions.

108
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,800
I'll make a Devil Hearth Oath.

109
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:57,640
Besides the two of us,

110
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:59,360
there is someone else on this mountain.

111
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:01,280
That person didn't climb to the top yet,

112
00:07:01,440 --> 00:07:02,920
they must be hiding somewhere

113
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,960
and watching us fight.

114
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:09,040
Could it be Hunchback Meng ?

115
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:11,560
Whoever it is,

116
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:13,720
we should leave quickly.

117
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:16,040
Too late !

118
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:32,800
It’s him !

119
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,440
The Core Formation brat

120
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:36,840
actually triggered the final restriction ?

121
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:39,520
Oh no... He’s gone mad, completely mad !

122
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:43,440
This fiend dared to attack two Soul Formation cultivators.

123
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,240
I will succeed

124
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:14,920
in this second trial !

125
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:23,960
Anger !

126
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:39,080
Master, look down the mountain.

127
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,640
This is bad !

128
00:08:58,920 --> 00:09:01,680
What... what kind of restriction is this ?

129
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:19,920
Brother Duanmu, if you hold back any longer

130
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:21,880
I fear neither of us will pass this second trial.

131
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:22,920
I know,

132
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,720
even if it costs us some cultivation

133
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:25,840
we must charge through.

134
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:32,920
Core Formation brat,

135
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:34,880
may you die a miserable death !

136
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,720
All in one...

137
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:50,760
One is all....

138
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:53,920
This restriction mountain is one single giant restriction.

139
00:09:58,800 --> 00:09:59,600
Pick it up.

140
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:09,240
This thing has no trace of spiritual energy.

141
00:10:09,680 --> 00:10:11,160
It’s probably already useless.

142
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:15,000
I can't probe it with my Divine Sense ?

143
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:22,720
Master,

144
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:26,160
you’re the only person left on this restriction mountain.

145
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:27,960
Stop dawdling,

146
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:29,560
let’s leave quickly.

147
00:10:29,880 --> 00:10:33,160
The final restriction is something even Soul Formation cultivators can’t withstand.

148
00:10:33,160 --> 00:10:34,520
I can’t force my way through it.

149
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:36,240
Besides, now that I’m the only one left,

150
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:37,840
I can take my time to study it.

151
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:51,440
I will sleep for a while then...

152
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:11,040
Are you done now ?

153
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:12,640
Are you done now ?

154
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:19,960
3 years later

155
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:25,560
What’s happening ?

156
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:35,640
The first chains with the second, the second with the third,

157
00:11:35,640 --> 00:11:36,960
all the restrictions are linked !

158
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:54,680
He solved it ?

159
00:11:54,680 --> 00:11:57,400
Finally, we can leave this cursed place !

160
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:05,040
I can’t move,

161
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:06,680
we’re doomed !

162
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:10,880
What’s going on ?

163
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:13,360
I clearly solved all the restrictions.

164
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,200
This...

165
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:26,760
My name is Tu Si.

166
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:31,440
You have solved all restrictions of Restriction Mountain.

167
00:12:32,040 --> 00:12:36,960
You are the fourth Enlightened of Restriction Mountain.

168
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:40,000
I'm here to give you the method to refine a Restriction Flag.

169
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:40,080
Tu Si
8-stars Ancient God

170
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:43,160
If you can enter my Sea of Consciousness

171
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:46,200
as an Enlightened,

172
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:49,680
you may receive a part of my memories of restrictions.

173
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:52,120
Each Enlightened

174
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:56,800
can also find a piece of Void Ink Stone in my Sea of Consciousness.

175
00:12:57,880 --> 00:13:01,760
This Void Ink Stone isn’t produced on any planet

176
00:13:02,160 --> 00:13:05,680
but only comes from the starry sky.

177
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:09,360
It's the essential material for crafting a Restriction Flag.

178
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:18,000
After you engrave 999 999 restrictions on that flag,

179
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:20,880
it will become a true Restriction Flag.

180
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:03,320
Explore it.

181
00:14:04,960 --> 00:14:07,840
The moment I come out, he always makes me do the hard work...

182
00:14:11,760 --> 00:14:13,960
Master, everything inside the pagoda is safe.

183
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:29,520
Nothing here can catch my eye. I'm very disappointed.
The Flood Dragon in the first trial was too weak.
It seems that this is all the Land of the Ancient God has to offer.

184
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:27,880
It’s him again !

185
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:29,280
Such an arrogant tone...

186
00:14:29,880 --> 00:14:31,640
It seems these perilous trials

187
00:14:32,280 --> 00:14:33,920
were effortless for him.

188
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:55,200
It looks like the previous Enlightened

189
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:56,880
took everything.

190
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:01,160
All that work for nothing.

191
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:17,840
They left something for us !

192
00:15:19,160 --> 00:15:20,280
If you don’t want to die,

193
00:15:20,280 --> 00:15:21,120
don’t touch it.

194
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:25,480
The reason this bag is still here

195
00:15:26,280 --> 00:15:27,960
must be because of that restriction.

196
00:15:35,840 --> 00:15:37,240
This restriction is too complex.

197
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:41,400
My current cultivation isn’t enough to solve it.

198
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:45,080
It’ll take many years before I can open it.

199
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:51,000
Go in.

200
00:15:52,040 --> 00:15:53,440
You're only giving me this little ?

201
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:55,400
Who knows what awaits me this time ?

202
00:16:03,160 --> 00:16:04,760
He knows the Death Spell.

203
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,320
Little brat,

204
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:09,480
if you can really help us in the third trial,

205
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:13,040
I wouldn't mind keeping you by my side forever.

206
00:16:13,800 --> 00:16:14,840
This gate

207
00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:18,080
must lead to the third trial, the Six Desires Devil Lord and company.

208
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:21,720
With my mere Core Formation cultivation

209
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:23,480
I have a very low chance

210
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:25,560
of passing it smoothly.

211
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:46,160
This place is...

212
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:48,360
Nirvana Space
Land of the Ancient God
Third trial

213
00:16:49,160 --> 00:16:50,400
another Foreign Battlefield ?

214
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:09,560
I see...

215
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:13,440
That's what the third trial is.

216
00:17:17,520 --> 00:19:39,960
In the donghua, Wang Lin finds a bag of holding at the end of the second trial. But the story is very different in the novel.

When Wang Lin was paying respects to Founder Chen Chong after learning the Divine Path in the War God Shrine, he checked out all the chambers and noticed that something was wrong. In one of the chambers he found a corpse that wasn't sitting down in mediation but floating. That corpse seemed to be absorbing the death energy of all the other corpses and showed signs of being alive. Wang Lin deduced that this person was not an Ancestor of the War God Shrine but an outsider that was cultivating here in secret. That person's bag of holding looked very different from all the other bags Wang Lin saw before so he decided to steal it. The bag was also sealed the same way it is in the donghua so he wasn't able to open it.

The donghua comes up with another explanation that leads to the same consequences. I'll put another note when that becomes relevant.

217
00:17:46,430 --> 00:17:53,310
Count the specks of time

218
00:17:50,310 --> 00:17:53,310
floating down gently.

219
00:17:53,670 --> 00:17:59,550
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.

220
00:18:00,670 --> 00:18:07,070
Forever lock away the scars

221
00:18:04,470 --> 00:18:07,070
of this mortal life.

222
00:18:07,330 --> 00:18:13,590
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

223
00:18:14,230 --> 00:18:21,310
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

224
00:18:16,910 --> 00:18:21,310
that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.

225
00:18:21,390 --> 00:18:28,470
The night-blooming flower cannot drink

226
00:18:23,430 --> 00:18:28,470
the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.

227
00:18:28,910 --> 00:18:30,990
I will ask the heavens who exactly

228
00:18:30,990 --> 00:18:35,750
sliced open this world

229
00:18:32,390 --> 00:18:35,750
to let the rain fall in.

230
00:18:35,750 --> 00:18:37,750
I will refine the world

231
00:18:37,830 --> 00:18:40,270
to make our palm lines say

232
00:18:40,470 --> 00:18:42,630
that we will live forever.

233
00:18:42,630 --> 00:18:45,550
Walking off the beaten path

234
00:18:45,550 --> 00:18:48,630
through heaven and earth.

235
00:18:49,910 --> 00:18:55,590
Before returning to dust,

236
00:18:51,830 --> 00:18:55,590
I will refine this mortal body.

237
00:18:57,110 --> 00:19:04,470
The left shore is the joyous laughter

238
00:19:00,990 --> 00:19:04,470
that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.

239
00:19:04,470 --> 00:19:11,070
The right shore is an eternal silence

240
00:19:06,070 --> 00:19:11,070
lingering under the candlelight.

241
00:19:11,270 --> 00:19:13,950
To overturn this fate,

242
00:19:13,950 --> 00:19:18,310
I will walk against the heavens.

243
00:19:18,750 --> 00:19:25,470
I will even gather the clouds

244
00:19:21,270 --> 00:19:25,470
to illuminate the sky for you.

245
00:19:25,870 --> 00:19:29,710
All this sadness was not meaningless.

246
00:19:29,710 --> 00:19:33,030
How many lives and deaths
have passed in the blink of an eye ?

247
00:19:33,030 --> 00:19:38,830
I vow to break

248
00:19:35,270 --> 00:19:38,830
this chess game of fate.

249
00:19:40,150 --> 00:19:49,790
I vow to break

250
00:19:41,950 --> 00:19:49,790
this chess game of fate.
